{"id":"46bb77ace51857a8","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-needed-prefix-and-rpc.md","title":"正规化项的必需前缀与模式闭合","display":"df-needed-prefix-and-rpc — 正规化项的必需前缀与模式闭合","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-needed-prefix-and-rpc","aliases":["56-df-needed-prefix-and-rpc"],"display":"df-needed-prefix-and-rpc — 正规化项的必需前缀与模式闭合","depends_on":["[[56-df-trace-ancestors]]","[[56-df-typed-redex-pattern]]","[[56-df-proofterm-embedding]]","[[56-df-normal-form]]"],"source_section":"§9.2 Definitions 9.2.13,9.2.17","source_printed_pages":"490–491","source_statement_status":"compared-to-local-djvu-ocr; explicit-orthogonal-interface","source_proof_status":"source-proof-and-local-derivation; not-machine-formalized"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-needed-prefix-and-rpc"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-needed-prefix-and-rpc</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-needed-prefix-and-rpc — 正规化项的必需前缀与模式闭合"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c39af7178b60264b\" href=\"?note=c39af7178b60264b\" title=\"56-df-trace-ancestors\">56-df-trace-ancestors</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b6aaae6fd581d4f1\" href=\"?note=b6aaae6fd581d4f1\" title=\"56-df-typed-redex-pattern\">56-df-typed-redex-pattern</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c273fed319bca9e3\" href=\"?note=c273fed319bca9e3\" title=\"56-df-proofterm-embedding\">56-df-proofterm-embedding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e295b2b3159f2b40\" href=\"?note=e295b2b3159f2b40\" title=\"56-df-normal-form\">56-df-normal-form</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§9.2 Definitions 9.2.13,9.2.17"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"490–491"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"compared-to-local-djvu-ocr; explicit-orthogonal-interface"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"source-proof-and-local-derivation; not-machine-formalized"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定正交系统。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Anc}_R,\\operatorname{TPos}\">\\(\\operatorname{Anc}_R,\\operatorname{TPos}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c39af7178b60264b\" href=\"?note=c39af7178b60264b\" title=\"56-df-trace-ancestors\">56-df-trace-ancestors</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RPat}_R\">\\(\\operatorname{RPat}_R\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b6aaae6fd581d4f1\" href=\"?note=b6aaae6fd581d4f1\" title=\"56-df-typed-redex-pattern\">56-df-typed-redex-pattern</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{wit}_R\">\\(\\operatorname{wit}_R\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c273fed319bca9e3\" href=\"?note=c273fed319bca9e3\" title=\"56-df-proofterm-embedding\">56-df-proofterm-embedding</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NF}(T,\\to_R,-)\">\\(\\mathrm{NF}(T,\\to_R,-)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e295b2b3159f2b40\" href=\"?note=e295b2b3159f2b40\" title=\"56-df-normal-form\">56-df-normal-form</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in T\">\\(s\\in T\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\subseteq\\operatorname{TPos}(s)\">\\(P\\subseteq\\operatorname{TPos}(s)\\)</span>；下式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NP}_R\">\\(\\operatorname{NP}_R\\)</span> 的定义域仅为所定义集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal N_R\">\\(\\mathcal N_R\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal N_R\\coloneqq\\{s\\in T:\\exists\\rho\\in\\mathcal F_R\\;(\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)=s\\land\\mathrm{NF}(T,\\to_R,\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho)))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal N_R\\coloneqq\\{s\\in T:\\exists\\rho\\in\\mathcal F_R\\;(\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)=s\\land\\mathrm{NF}(T,\\to_R,\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho)))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NPaths}_R(s)\\coloneqq\\{\\rho\\in\\mathcal F_R:\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)=s\\land\\mathrm{NF}(T,\\to_R,\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{NPaths}_R(s)\\coloneqq\\{\\rho\\in\\mathcal F_R:\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)=s\\land\\mathrm{NF}(T,\\to_R,\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NP}_R(s)\\coloneqq\\bigcap_{\\rho\\in\\operatorname{NPaths}_R(s)}\\operatorname{Anc}_R(\\operatorname{wit}_R(\\rho),\\operatorname{TPos}(\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho)))\\quad(s\\in\\mathcal N_R).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{NP}_R(s)\\coloneqq\\bigcap_{\\rho\\in\\operatorname{NPaths}_R(s)}\\operatorname{Anc}_R(\\operatorname{wit}_R(\\rho),\\operatorname{TPos}(\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho)))\\quad(s\\in\\mathcal N_R).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RPC}_R(s,P)\\iff\\forall u\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{RPat}_R((s,u,\\operatorname{ctr}_R(s,u)))\\subseteq P\\lor\\operatorname{RPat}_R((s,u,\\operatorname{ctr}_R(s,u)))\\cap P=\\varnothing\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RPC}_R(s,P)\\iff\\forall u\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{RPat}_R((s,u,\\operatorname{ctr}_R(s,u)))\\subseteq P\\lor\\operatorname{RPat}_R((s,u,\\operatorname{ctr}_R(s,u)))\\cap P=\\varnothing\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>NP先用非空正规形路径族的交定义，保证即使尚未证明路径无关时也是明确集合；下游证明各祖先集合相同后，它才与书中“任取一条归约”的needed prefix等价。定义域N_R显式排除没有正规形的项，不使用空族交。RPC允许模式全在集合内或全在外，禁止跨边界；采用顶点和边的同一个typed模式，不能只约束根位置。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-trace-ancestors","status":"resolved","id":"c39af7178b60264b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-trace-ancestors]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-typed-redex-pattern","status":"resolved","id":"b6aaae6fd581d4f1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-typed-redex-pattern]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-proofterm-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"c273fed319bca9e3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-proofterm-embedding]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-normal-form","status":"resolved","id":"e295b2b3159f2b40","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-normal-form]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-trace-ancestors","status":"resolved","id":"c39af7178b60264b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定正交系统。$\\operatorname{Anc}_R,\\operatorname{TPos}$ 见 [[56-df-trace-ancestors]]，$\\operatorname{RPat}_R$ 见 [[56-df-typed-redex-pattern]]，$\\operatorname{wit}_R$ 见 [[56-df-proofterm-embedding]]，$\\mathrm{NF}(T,\\to_R,-)$ 见 [[56-df-normal-form]]。$s\\in T$，$P\\subseteq\\operatorname{TPos}(s)$；下式 $\\operatorname{NP}_R$ 的定义域仅为所定义集合 $\\mathcal N_R$。","embed":fa